@startuml
' A `switch`: one diamond above its cases, a line from either corner to
' the cases on that side and from its foot to the one in the middle, as
' PlantUML draws it; an empty case goes straight on, one that stops ends.
start
switch (What kind of order is it?)
case (online)
  :Ship it;
case (in store)
case (by phone)
  :Call back;
  stop
case (fax)
  :Read it;
  :Type it in;
case (post)
  :Open it;
endswitch
:Done;
stop
@enduml
